    <!-- ===== Privacy ===== -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_1">ScreenLens processes supported text recognition and diagnostics on the device whenever possible.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_2">Screen captures are not uploaded to a ScreenLens server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_3">Saved history is stored locally on your device using an on-device database, and can be cleared at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_4">Downloading an offline translation language model contacts Google\'s ML Kit translation service to fetch that model file. No screen captures, images, clipboard text or history are sent as part of that request.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_5">Text recognition (OCR), language detection, translation and barcode scanning run using Google ML Kit\'s on-device models. Once a translation model is downloaded, translation for that language pair works fully offline.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_6">The Floating Lens and screen-capture features only run when you explicitly start them, and screen capture stops as soon as analysis finishes.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body_7">Free builds show ads served by Google AdMob, which may use an advertising identifier as permitted by your device and consent settings. Premium removes ads.</string>

